---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Security — VibeStats"
  description="How to report a security issue affecting VibeStats."
>
  <main class="docs-content max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1>Security</h1>
    <p>
      To report a possible vulnerability, <a
        href="https://github.com/stephenleo/vibestats/issues/new"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">open a GitHub issue</a
      > with a brief description and no sensitive exploit details. The maintainer will arrange a private
      follow-up if needed.
    </p>
    <p>For ordinary bugs and support requests, use the same issue tracker.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
